{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third Shift is the first ever hybrid, point-and-click, survival horror video game, to take place in a pharmacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/1_About_The_Game__0-00-01-04_.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Main_Menu_Credit_-_Copy.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/pickey_jumpscare_power_on_png__0-00-00-00_.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/2_About_The_Developer__0-00-01-04_.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/left_view_no_power2.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/3_Connection_of_Third_Shift__0-00-01-04_.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Composite_1.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third Shift is a first-of-its-kind survival horror game set in the eerie, high-stakes world of a late-night pharmacy. You play as a pharmacist under extreme pressure, not just from managing dangerous drug interactions and corporate metrics, but from confronting terrifying supernatural threats that unfold with every shift. Combining point-and-click mechanics with sit-and-survive gameplay, Third Shift blends fast-paced reflexes, immersive storytelling, and chilling psychological tension in a setting that\u2019s never been explored in horror gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Composite_4.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind the scenes, I\u2019ve composed over 36 original music tracks planned for the final game, carefully designed to heighten tension, reinforce narrative themes, and shape the player\u2019s emotional experience. New animations, refined mechanics, and deeper narrative elements have also been developed, hinting at a dark conspiracy spanning centuries. Every update is shaped by the amazing feedback from our community, and now, we\u2019re inviting you to become part of that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KICKSTARTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Cover_Photo.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a shout-out in the game? Back the kickstarter now and get access to one of the several affordable tier rewards which include: a credit in the main menu of the game, a credit in the credits section of the game, a 4K wallpaper pack, and more! Hurry before the 50% discount offers expire! Not only that, but all tier rewards also come with a download key for the full release of Third Shift which will be redeemable at the release of the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Copy_of_the_game_soundtrack.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Credits_Reward.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Exclusive_BTS_cover_photo_preview.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Credit_in_the_main_menu.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Digital_4K_Wallpaper_Pack.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Limited_Edition_Digital_Art.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Shout-out_in_a_Thank-You_video.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOCIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay connected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kickstarter: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instagram: @thirdshifthorror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thread: @thirdshifthorror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YouTube: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instagram: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430720?t=1746718451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430720?t=1746718451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/7d357bfb587bcfff64adea3fe6cff1218089bfa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746718451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/7d357bfb587bcfff64adea3fe6cff1218089bfa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746718451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Special Announcements</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Announcements will be posted here!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third Shift is the first ever hybrid, point-and-click, survival horror video game, to take place in a pharmacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/1_About_The_Game__0-00-01-04_.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Main_Menu_Credit_-_Copy.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/pickey_jumpscare_power_on_png__0-00-00-00_.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/2_About_The_Developer__0-00-01-04_.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/left_view_no_power2.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/3_Connection_of_Third_Shift__0-00-01-04_.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Composite_1.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third Shift is a first-of-its-kind survival horror game set in the eerie, high-stakes world of a late-night pharmacy. You play as a pharmacist under extreme pressure, not just from managing dangerous drug interactions and corporate metrics, but from confronting terrifying supernatural threats that unfold with every shift. Combining point-and-click mechanics with sit-and-survive gameplay, Third Shift blends fast-paced reflexes, immersive storytelling, and chilling psychological tension in a setting that\u2019s never been explored in horror gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Composite_4.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind the scenes, I\u2019ve composed over 36 original music tracks planned for the final game, carefully designed to heighten tension, reinforce narrative themes, and shape the player\u2019s emotional experience. New animations, refined mechanics, and deeper narrative elements have also been developed, hinting at a dark conspiracy spanning centuries. Every update is shaped by the amazing feedback from our community, and now, we\u2019re inviting you to become part of that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KICKSTARTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Cover_Photo.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a shout-out in the game? Back the kickstarter now and get access to one of the several affordable tier rewards which include: a credit in the main menu of the game, a credit in the credits section of the game, a 4K wallpaper pack, and more! Hurry before the 50% discount offers expire! Not only that, but all tier rewards also come with a download key for the full release of Third Shift which will be redeemable at the release of the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Copy_of_the_game_soundtrack.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Credits_Reward.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Exclusive_BTS_cover_photo_preview.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Credit_in_the_main_menu.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Digital_4K_Wallpaper_Pack.png?t=1746718451\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Limited_Edition_Digital_Art.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/extras/Shout-out_in_a_Thank-You_video.png?t=1746718451\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOCIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay connected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kickstarter: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instagram: @thirdshifthorror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thread: @thirdshifthorror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YouTube: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instagram: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jonhenry Cambero"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430720/a719466ab8cbf055ffaaaee7477a6d6a8d415018/header.jpg?t=1746718451","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sequoia 15.3.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics 655 1536 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":tru